* File size expressions and DATAF1 with a date (OCL-03, OCL-09, RV-40).
* From SC41-4731 chapter 3. S is the allocated size, A the number of records.
// FILE NAME-FILEB,BLOCKS-?F'S,FILEA'?
// FILE NAME-FILEB,RECORDS-?F'A,FILEA'?
* With the creation date of the file (session date format)
// FILE NAME-FILEC,BLOCKS-?F'S,FILEA,102926'?
// EVALUATE P1=?F'S,CUSTMST'?
// EVALUATE P2=?F'S,CUSTMST,102926'?
// EVALUATE P3=?F'A,CUSTMST'?+?F'A,WORK'?
// IF ?F'S,CUSTMST'?/00000050 GOTO SIZE
// IF ?F'S,CUSTMST,102926'?/00000050 GOTO SIZE
* DATAF1: name, name with date (mmddyy, ddmmyy, yymmdd), name with ALL
// IF DATAF1-CUSTMST GOTO FOUND
// IF DATAF1-'CUSTMST,102926' GOTO FOUND
// IFF DATAF1-'CUSTMST,102926' GOTO MISSING
// IFT DATAF1-'CUSTMST,261029' GOTO FOUND
// IF DATAF1-'?2?,102926' GOTO FOUND
// IF DATAF1-'CUST,ALL' GOTO ANY
* A library name (a library with a date gives a false condition)
// IF DATAF1-MYLIB GOTO LIBOK
// TAG FOUND
// TAG MISSING
// TAG SIZE
// TAG ANY
// TAG LIBOK
